Kontor

Kontor was originally built by Martin Betz (AI Traction, https://ai-traction.de,
and UTXO Solutions GmbH) to keep the books of his own companies. It is shared
as-is for anyone who wants to use it for their own bookkeeping.

AI Traction is not a publisher or vendor of tax or bookkeeping software and
offers no bookkeeping or tax services to others. Kontor is not tax, legal or
accounting advice. There is no support, no service and no warranty.

